{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Egg\n🥚 Secret, optional key object, one per chapter, always delivered by the [[Forgotten Man]] in a different hidden area each time.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/man_egg.png","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Forgotten Man**\nHe is the one who delivers each Egg, always to Kris and always in a different secret area.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND**\nThe Eggs are, according to Pink's revelation, the \"protein\" that attracts FRIEND in its hunting-cat form.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Mad Mew Mew (Pink)**\nShe is the one who reveals the connection between the Eggs and FRIEND, in a secret dialogue only available after meeting several specific conditions in Ch.5.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Is the Ch.4 Egg room a child therapy room?**\nA theory from an analysis video, but with a much more solid basis than usual: in the May 2025 update to the Spamton Sweepstakes (more than a month before Ch.3 and Ch.4 came out), one was added…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Why do they \"protect\" Kris from FRIEND?**\nIf the Eggs are literally protein for FRIEND, one reading is that the Forgotten Man gives them to Kris not as a simple collectible, but as an indirect way of protecting him — giving him something that FRIEND…","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Man_overworld_tree.gif","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mad_Mew_Mew_Pink.gif","x":420,"y":10,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/man_Therapy_room_location.png.webp","x":-91,"y":865,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3_x0","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e4_x0","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"}]}